*  m1_defer_LEN0.sno -- FINDING-2026-08-17-s139 sec.2 table, row 3 (defer_LEN0).
*
*  Same shape as m1_defer_ALT.sno but Sp DROPS the SPAN alternate -- Sp is
*  LEN(0) alone, which matches the null string and never carves.  This is
*  the STANDING GREEN COUNTER-WITNESS: it must stay "ok" through any defer-
*  record widening, per the s139 residue note ("do NOT land on a single-
*  witness green").  Subject has NO spaces -- nothing for a carve to find.
*  Oracle (SPITBOL x64 sbl -b): ok.  scrip HEAD @ s139: ok (already passes).
         &ANCHOR      =  1
         Word         =  SPAN('ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ')
         Sp           =  LEN(0)
         Command      =  Word *Sp
         L            =  ARBNO(*Command)
         Src          =  'STARTHERE'
         Src          POS(0) L RPOS(0)                            :F(FA)
         OUTPUT       =  'ok'                                     :(END)
FA       OUTPUT       =  'FAIL'
END
